  "text": "If you are intimidated by complicated Notion setups with fifty databases, start right here. Most beginners download aesthetic templates filled with linked properties, rollups, and formulas they never use. Over-engineering your dashboard turns simple note-taking into a maintenance nightmare that stalls your work. Instead, create one page split into three basic sections: daily tasks, active projects, and quick notes. This lightweight dashboard organizes your week in five minutes flat.",
